Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.43,0:01:04.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（父亲的诅咒）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:08.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（悬赏通缉 杰克·斯派罗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:10.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赏金100英镑 不论死活）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:03.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（飞翔的荷兰人号）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:56.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（九年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:02.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未知海域）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（悬赏通缉 杰克·斯派罗）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:40.78,Title,0,0,0,0,,《加勒比海盗5：死无对证》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:44.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加勒比 圣马丁）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:58.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（犬类禁入 女士止步）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（G·W·斯威夫特律师）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.63,0:28:45.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杰克·斯派罗 臭名昭著的海盗 赏金1英镑 不论死活）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.04,0:50:02.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（垂死海鸥号）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.49,1:05:38.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（邪恶神女号）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.28,1:17:02.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（垂死海鸥号）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.20,1:18:09.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（刽子手湾 不欢迎陌生人）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 你来干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I'd find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰人号不是你该来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no place for you on the Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回去找你妈妈去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get home to your mother. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁现在还来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不走 我不会罢休的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't! I'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是把我扔下船 我肯定还会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you throw me over, I'll come straight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被诅咒困在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see I'm cursed to this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法打破你身上的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know a way to break your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你离开荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}To free you from the Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件神器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read about a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,神器掌控着大海的一切神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A treasure that holds all the power of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,海神波塞冬的三叉戟可以救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident of Poseidon can break your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 三叉戟你是找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, the Trident can never be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连你都找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是传说而己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你和杰克·斯派罗船长的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the tales of you and Captain Jack Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克会帮我找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will help me find the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许去找杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别回大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the sea forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能再这样像个… - 像个海盗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to stop acting like… - A pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拦不住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.51,0:04:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你解除不了我的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my curse will never be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep even keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝背风向靠拢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul in on the lee side!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿推 你们这群舱底的耗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, you pathetic bilge rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧给我把这里的水抽出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll pump the bilge and fill the scuppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在全力追击海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're chasing down pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 快点儿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心他们又把你赶下船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna get kicked off another ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一艘荷兰船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Dutch barque.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,兴许被海盗邦尼特给占了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably stolen by the Pirate Bonnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.47,0:06:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道擅离岗位的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you of leaving your post, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟船长说句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak with the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要进魔鬼三角区\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going in, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不能追\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再追了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有权力跟船长说话 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not address the captain, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 您看看地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, look at your charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往前开就要把船开到魔鬼三角了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're sailing us into the Devil's Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听听 这新来的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear this, men? This landsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真信那老掉牙的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}believes an old sailor's myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, with all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长年研究海洋的神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have spent my life studying the myths of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道所有的传说和诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know every legend and every curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,船开进了魔鬼三角区的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know ships that sail into the Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就很难再开出来了 - 抱歉 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- do not necessarily sail out… - I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家伙显然是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is clearly disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我 船长 改变航向吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, trust in what I say. Change your course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢命令我 臭小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dare to give me orders, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让你害死一船人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let you kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是叛变\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.03,0:07:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关起来 继续前进 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lock him up. We're going in! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,固定右舷的转帆索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belay that starboard brace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拴紧绳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bind that line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧绳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay to the chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次饶你不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your last chance, Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我的话早把你吊死在桅杆上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it were up to me, I'd string you from the yardarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}On deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵手 稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold steady, helmsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋在圣马丁岛上墓碑都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried in an unmarked grave on the Isle of Saint Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 水里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's something in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那算不上是船 是船的残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no ship, sir. It's a shipwreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它朝我们开过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sailing straight toward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹 开炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know this pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只听说过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.41,0:12:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a "yes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年 我们被魔鬼三角区诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}For too many years, the Triangle has cursed us…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直困在这人间地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}condemned us to this hell on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离这里的关键 就是杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to our escape is Jack Sparrow…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他那该死的罗盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the compass which he holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不用害怕 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to fear me, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向会留下个活口作为见证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always leave one man alive to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我去找到斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Sparrow for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,带个话给他 就说船长萨拉查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and relay a message from Captain Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 我一定会重见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I will behold the daylight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on that day…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}death…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,会直接找上他的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}death will come straight for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想亲口告诉他 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could do it myself, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人开不了口\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead men tell no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜·史密斯 你无父无母 乃恶魔之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina Smyth, you're an orphan born of the devil…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.03,0:13:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被指控使用巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}accused of practising witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,临死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you die…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么需要坦白的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have anything to confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坦白 我不是一个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess that I'm not a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是相信科学而己\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am a woman of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坦白我独自生存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess that I have survived on my own…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠的是我从未见过面的父亲的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nothing but a diary from the father I never knew…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 对我身世的探寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a quest for the truth of who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坦白 我到死也不会放弃探寻真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess that I will die before I give up the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I confess…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们谈话的时候 我把锁撬开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that while we've been talking, I picked this lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 让我们庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we dedicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣马丁皇家银行开业\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Royal Bank of Saint Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们加勒比海地区最安全的银行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most secure banking institution in the Caribbean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的金库 有5英寸厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our new vault is five inches thick…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量超过了1吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and weighs an imperial ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 她在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got her! I've got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让她跑了 拦住那女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let her get away! Stop that witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿追 她在那儿 拦住那个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop her! She's there! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这家银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this bank…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们圣马丁城\N{\fnArial\fs30}the town of Saint Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此就迈入了现代化城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}enters the modern world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉 长官 - 那女巫逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry, sir. - The witch escaped her chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我把她抓回来 否则你们就代她去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find that wicked lass, or you'll swing in her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人 也没有军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man nor an army…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢来抢我们圣马丁城的金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}can ever rob the gold from Saint Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把金库打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 海盗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,海… 海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来还真是有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may seem a peculiar request…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你们有没有人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but could someone explain to me as.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.31,0:16:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么在这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to why I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.29,0:16:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等等 我快想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, it's coming to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我稍微清醒一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need just a moment to clear me head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,金库里还有个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woman with him in the vault!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不用管那个 荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind about that trollop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长 我觉得 那是您的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I believe that's your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frances?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来了 我在抢银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it! I'm robbing the bank!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot him! - Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,原计划不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追 别让他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After him! Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是去买了块羊肉嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got this mutton, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 羊肉好贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was too expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的望远镜从来没让女人动过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No woman's ever handled my Herschel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear a path!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 停下 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右急转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天文定向不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your celestial fix was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我往北调了两度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've adjusted two degrees North.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后你的地图不会再有偏差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your map will no longer be imprecise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你得从头画图了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although you will have to start again with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.93,0:20:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把两百颗恒星录入星表 就成女巫了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a witch for having catalogued over 200 stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,血月就要出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a blood moon coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想买一个航海钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply need to purchase a chronometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出双倍价钱买这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay you double for selling to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女巫在我店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a witch in my shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人 我店里有女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! There's a witch in my shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的店里有个女巫和海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a witch and a pirate in my shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天可真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's your lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们四个看到我的银行了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have either of the four of you seen my bank?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,原计划里有你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you part of the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:20:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你活着多没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a horrible way to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让女巫跑了 抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that witch! Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑不了了 要怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那儿 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there she is! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要尖叫一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 抓住那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there! Secure that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卑鄙无耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You filthy pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没叫你骂我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need for name-calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lads!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack! - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.57,0:22:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有桥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,白忙活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那… 那钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the dosh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.93,0:22:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为抢银行很容易？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that robbing a bank is easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一个子儿都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gaggle of gutless heels of the womb's guilty…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.03,0:22:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是因为被你们这群唧唧歪歪的饭桶害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of putting me in this dreadful pickle in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都排好队 照规矩上贡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now line up and offer me your tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还找我们要钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to pay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.50,0:23:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这艘船的船长吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I not the captain of this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.49,0:23:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你这个 也叫船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的宝藏呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都快要饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us are starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再跟着一个没有船的船长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will no longer follow a captain without a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.57,0:23:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.72,0:23:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的黑珍珠号一直在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Pearl has never left me side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在巴波萨才是海上的霸主 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The pirate Barbossa rules these seas now. - Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.95,0:23:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有十艘船 弹药充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has 10 ships, guns full.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.03,0:23:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提他的炮弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention his cannonballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说一个有十八磅重呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 pounds each they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那瘸子的蛋蛋有那么重？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One-legged man with 18 pound balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪他走不动路\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he walks funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come, come, mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.65,0:23:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是一起找到了马其顿的宝藏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we not find the Treasure of Macedonia together?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是一堆烂木头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a troll of rotten wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.89,0:23:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈达斯国王的金子 - 是一堆驴粪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gold of King Midas. - Pile of donkey dung.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,认了吧 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是流年不利 霉运缠身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad luck dogs you day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我运气好得很 你别乱说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that is a blatant fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.70,0:23:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的好运到头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你的船员也走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you've lost your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗再也不是我们的船长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow is no longer our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.91,0:24:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们俩算是走到尽头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've reached the end of the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.09,0:24:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都走吧 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all dismissed. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.25,0:24:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都 被解雇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of ya, dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.23,0:24:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后再也不能跟着杰克·斯派罗船长出海了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never sail with Captain Jack Sparrow again,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.77,0:24:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.32,0:25:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,全城人都在谈论你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole town speaks of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,君王号上唯一的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only survivor of the Monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.67,0:25:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就靠一块浮木\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy who paddled all the way to Saint Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.55,0:25:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路逆流而上划到了圣马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the tide on a piece of driftwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.55,0:25:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现你的时候 你念叨着海盗和三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found jabbering about pirates and tridents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 请您去掉这些镣铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sir, let me go of these chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.57,0:25:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责是保卫这座岛和这片海域\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job is to protect this island and these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.57,0:25:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的袖子 被撕掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your sleeves have been ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.73,0:25:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的船遭到了海盗的… - 那你就是临阵脱逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were attacked by the dead… - You're a coward who ran from battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.57,0:25:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,按逃兵处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is how you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你不是逃兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.48,0:26:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我一个人待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave me, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.19,0:26:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒着生命危险来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've risked my life to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了证实传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see if the rumours are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.34,0:26:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道三叉戟的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of the Trident?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.79,0:26:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.51,0:26:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要找三叉戟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why you seek the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟能破除一切海上诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident can break any curse at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.75,0:26:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲就是被一道诅咒给困住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is trapped by such a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.65,0:26:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒这种事根本没有科学依据\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're aware that curses are not supported by science.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.03,0:26:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可死人在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither are ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.79,0:26:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你确实疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.20,0:26:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不该来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.40,0:26:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.17,0:26:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是想要离开这座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I need to get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.30,0:26:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解读无人能… - 无人能懂的海图？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To solve The Map No Man… - No Man Can Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.88,0:26:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,海神波塞冬留下的海图？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left by Poseidon himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过那个传说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've read the ancient text?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.93,0:26:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还看过所有的译本\N{\fnArial\fs30}In each language they were written.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.93,0:26:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没人见过那张海图 没人可以看得懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this map has never been seen nor read by any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.73,0:26:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别小瞧了女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily, I'm a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.93,0:27:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 是伽利略的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the diary of Galileo Galilei.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.12,0:27:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一生都在不停地寻找那个三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent his life searching for the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.93,0:27:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他发明了天文望远镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why he invented the spyglass…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.06,0:27:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以天文学家才总是盯着天空看\N{\fnArial\fs30}why astronomers have spent their lives staring into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.87,0:27:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那无人能懂的海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying The Map No Man Can Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.49,0:27:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是藏在星空里的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is hidden in the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.68,0:27:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是父亲留给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was left to me by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.81,0:27:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信我能找到别人都找不到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed I could find what no man has ever found.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会让他失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will not let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 就会出现血月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon there will be a blood moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.19,0:27:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有到那时 我才能看懂海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only then can the map be read.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.06,0:27:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Trident found.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.29,0:27:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.29,0:27:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜·史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.31,0:27:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想救你父亲就必须先救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to save your father, you'll have to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.23,0:27:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄一艘船 我们去找三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find us a ship and the Trident will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.22,0:27:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回来 女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn to me, witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.17,0:27:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.28,0:27:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把逃兵抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find that coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.48,0:28:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他和女巫一起吊死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll hang with the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.69,0:28:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫杰克船长去洗洗澡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Captain Jack's washed up, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.06,0:28:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都不用洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've not had a wash in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.97,0:28:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜查那条巷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the alley down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 去教堂 其他人 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, check the church. The rest of you, with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.82,0:28:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.05,0:28:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能赏口酒喝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I please have a drink, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把钱拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me your silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.51,0:28:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.58,0:29:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个交易吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一瓶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitán, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.57,0:30:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.16,0:30:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗刚刚放弃了他的罗盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow has given away the compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.98,0:30:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光 阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daylight. Daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.77,0:30:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are free!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.28,0:31:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 该去找那个海盗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now. It's time to hunt a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirate's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.00,0:31:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝儿 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to daddy. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.44,0:31:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙正是我们要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the man we've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.70,0:31:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？找我干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why am I looked for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.64,0:31:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知全城 海盗杰克·斯派罗被抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it be known that the pirate, Jack Sparrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.05,0:31:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be executed at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.15,0:31:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,处决我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.85,0:31:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后再也不来你们这儿了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never set foot in this town again, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.16,0:31:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.63,0:31:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死期到了 无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead now, you cur.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.00,0:31:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do mean it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.54,0:31:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证再也不来你们这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall never be back here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.03,0:33:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要释放海之神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To release the power of the sea…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.92,0:33:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,则将一切分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}"all must divide."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.50,0:33:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.41,0:33:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星指向一座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars lead to an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.96,0:33:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这儿 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look right here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.64,0:33:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 把其他几个关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good. Take the rest to the cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找一个海盗 杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a pirate. Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.09,0:33:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugger off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.20,0:34:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你打听个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst. I need to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.53,0:34:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的剑给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.69,0:34:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.85,0:34:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当兵的怎么会没有剑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of soldier has no weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.07,0:34:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因为叛逃被通缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm currently wanted for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.08,0:34:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你不是个好兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not the very good kind then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.48,0:34:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找一个海盗 杰克·斯派罗船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a pirate. Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.35,0:34:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你今天可真走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, today is your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.96,0:34:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我刚好就是你要找的那个船长 杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I just happen to be Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.00,0:34:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.95,0:34:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找了那么多年的… 就是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent years searching for… this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.29,0:34:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的杰克·斯派罗 怎么会是一个坐牢的酒鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great Jack Sparrow is not some drunk in a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.47,0:34:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船呢？船员呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even have a ship? A crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.49,0:34:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,裤子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.36,0:34:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的海盗从不在意这些小细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great pirate does not require such intricacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这一刻我等了多久吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how long I've been waiting for this moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.66,0:34:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒着生命危险混进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risks I've taken to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:34:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的就是那个杰克·斯派罗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you're the Jack Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.66,0:34:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最该问的是 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real question is, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.20,0:35:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亨利·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Henry Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.80,0:35:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是威尔·特纳和伊丽莎白·斯万的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Will Turner and Elizabeth Swann.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.78,0:35:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩生了你这个坏小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the evil spawn of them two?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.04,0:35:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈是不是跟你提起过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does mommy ever ask about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.25,0:35:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.60,0:35:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她梦里还叫我的名字吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She call my name in her sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.68,0:35:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没提起过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never spoke of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.07,0:35:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的是那两个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we're talking about the same people?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.50,0:35:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,男的被诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a cursed eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.24,0:35:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,女的一头金发 很固执 噘着嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's golden-haired, stubborn, pouty lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.05,0:35:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子像长颈鹿 还有一对丰满的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neck like a giraffe. And two of those wonderful…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.43,0:35:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes, it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.10,0:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你听我说 杰克 我现在只能指望你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to listen, Jack, because at the moment you're all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.62,0:35:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么救我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a way to save my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.64,0:35:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件神器可以打破诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one thing that can break his curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.30,0:35:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他离开荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and free him from the Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.24,0:35:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,海神波塞冬的三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident of Poseidon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.94,0:35:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 要找到这件宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. The treasure to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.39,0:35:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得靠谁也看不懂的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}with The Map That No Man Can Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.35,0:35:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.83,0:35:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还关着一个女孩儿 她有那张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a girl inside this prison, Jack, who holds that map.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.23,0:36:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮己经变红 三叉戟就要现世\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moon has turned to blood, the Trident will be found…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.11,0:36:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为掌握大海的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you could be the one who holds the sea…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.76,0:36:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像从前那样意气风发\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with it become all that you once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.94,0:36:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.04,0:36:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.93,0:36:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是对不起 你还在说啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. Were you still talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.14,0:36:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该是睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I nodded off a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.92,0:36:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.42,0:36:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人让我把话带给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message from someone you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫萨拉查的船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Captain Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.62,0:36:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认识一个西班牙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once knew a Spaniard named…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.66,0:36:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个西班牙名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}something in Spanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.74,0:36:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Matador Del Mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.64,0:36:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,海上屠夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Butcher of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.06,0:36:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他？不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.42,0:36:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 他死了 死得透透的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite happily, he's dead. Very, very dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.36,0:36:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船都沉了 - 就在魔鬼三角区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ship went down. - Inside the Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.55,0:36:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming for you, Jack,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.65,0:36:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像鬼故事里讲的那样 他要来复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to seek revenge as the dead man's tale is told.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.55,0:36:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都说什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.82,0:36:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你的罗盘是他逃脱的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said your compass was the key to his escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.43,0:36:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人大军现在直奔你而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}An army of dead are coming straight for you, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.13,0:36:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,海神波塞冬的三叉戟 是你唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident of Poseidon is your only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.57,0:37:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们达成共识了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have an accord?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.66,0:37:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要进去跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not going in there to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.61,0:37:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你要说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.07,0:37:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 你去跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was my idea for you to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.25,0:37:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你比较讨他喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes you more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.80,0:37:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他谁都不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't like anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.71,0:37:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.84,0:37:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道您说过绝对不能打扰您\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you said never to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.57,0:37:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事不能随便进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to come in without good cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.40,0:37:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算有事也要先 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to speak without first, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.86,0:37:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要先问问自己…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asking ourselves…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.34,0:37:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问自己 这事是不是真的有必要报告给您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether our thoughts were absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.43,0:37:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像船着火那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the time the ship was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.17,0:37:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是个有必要报告的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That being an example of necessary thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.61,0:38:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我们再次道歉 为 为 为了那次大火道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, again, we do apologise for starting that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.69,0:38:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.34,0:38:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是您的船 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your ships, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.37,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,接连遭袭击 但是对方不为钱财\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're being attacked by an enemy that takes no riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.60,0:38:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 平白无故地杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kills without provocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.57,0:38:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.53,0:38:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三艘己经沉了 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three have already been sunk, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.04,0:38:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说对方的船长叫萨拉曼德\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been sunk by a captain called Salamander.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.91,0:38:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨马瓦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samovar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.83,0:38:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉查？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是萨拉查 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, your sirness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次他都留下一个活口 帮他传话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He leaves one man from each vessel to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.23,0:38:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的船一艘一艘地沉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire fleet is being sunk…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.46,0:38:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快要… 要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll soon be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.93,0:38:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我们也要失业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quite possibly out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.63,0:38:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你们的女巫谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be needing some time with your witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.01,0:39:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我己经恭候多时了 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been expecting you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.07,0:39:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要喝一杯茶吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd like some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.72,0:39:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,茶就不必了 你太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall pass. Thank ye kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.44,0:39:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,进我的门要付出血的代价 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The price of crossing my door is blood, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.46,0:39:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得我看你这儿的生意也不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That explains why you're not so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.09,0:39:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,每笔账我都收回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone pays eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.89,0:39:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊萨 我们过去是有协定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shansa, you and I made a bond long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.78,0:39:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你从纹刑架上救下来 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you from the gallows, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.25,0:39:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你诅咒了敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I cursed your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.77,0:39:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你又怕了 又来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you come to me in fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.30,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为死人己经掌控了整个海面\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the dead have taken command of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.39,0:39:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些死人为什么找上我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would the dead be wanting with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.62,0:39:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是找你 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要找一只麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're searching for a Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.09,0:39:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.82,0:40:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克要去寻找三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack will sail for the Trident…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.92,0:40:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着女孩和珍珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a girl and a Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.86,0:40:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那三叉戟 没有人能找得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident can never be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟是杰克唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident is Jack's only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.07,0:40:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人大军虽然在海上无敌 却无法上岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead are conquering the sea, unable to step on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.18,0:40:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你远离大海 去乡下养老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should retire to the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.52,0:40:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我去乡下？开牧场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean grass? On a farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.15,0:40:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤牛奶 做奶酪是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milkin' a cow, makin' cheese,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.34,0:40:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的财宝怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}while they sink my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.10,0:40:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得问你自己 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask yourself this, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.95,0:40:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是值得你舍命守护的宝贝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a treasure worth dying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.22,0:40:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.00,0:40:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.67,0:40:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎样才能守住我的东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do I save what be mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.30,0:40:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克有一个罗盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack held a compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.11,0:40:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够指引你找到你最渴望的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}which points you to the thing you desire most.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.04,0:40:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若背弃罗盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}But betray the compass,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.08,0:40:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将释放你最深的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it releases your greatest fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.57,0:41:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗最惧怕的就是萨拉查 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pirate's greatest fear be Salazar, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么在你手上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.37,0:41:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们去 别等杰克找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead them to Jack before he finds the Trident…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.30,0:41:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所有的宝贝 就会回到你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all your treasure will come back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.35,0:41:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来要跟死人做个交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to make a deal with the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.29,0:41:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 别磨蹭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.09,0:41:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.63,0:41:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.73,0:41:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克大叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.08,0:41:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克小子 最近好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie boy! How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.57,0:41:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么可抱怨的 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't complain really. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.44,0:41:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一上午就等一顿打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waitin' all morning in here for a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.87,0:41:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的服务太差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the service is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.79,0:41:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.34,0:41:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.20,0:41:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,海水己被血染红\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oceans have turned to blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.38,0:41:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好待在陆地上 更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to stay on dry land where it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.05,0:42:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就要死在陆地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to be executed on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.33,0:42:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你讲过骷髅的笑话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I ever tell you the one about the skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.61,0:42:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 讲过很多次 - 一个骷髅来到酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you have. Many times, in fact. - Skeleton goes into a bar…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.49,0:42:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要了杯啤酒和拖把\N{\fnArial\fs30}orders a beer and a mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.29,0:42:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.77,0:42:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.78,0:42:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他们要是掏你肠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if they disembowel you,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫维克托来干\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask for Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下手最轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the softest hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.70,0:42:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 报我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you! - And mention my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.62,0:42:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能保住你的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't cut your feet off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.54,0:42:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 你是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.20,0:42:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么死啊 海盗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how would you like to die, pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.63,0:43:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,纹刑？枪决？还是最新发明的断头台？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging, firing squad, or a new invention: the guillotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.79,0:43:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,断头台？是法国的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guillotine? Sounds French.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.48,0:43:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢法国货 你知道吗？他们发明了蛋黄酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the French. Did you know that they invented mayonnaise?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.52,0:43:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏不到哪儿去 是法国的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad could it be? It's French, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.10,0:43:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是这样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.31,0:43:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've changed me mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.93,0:43:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 求你们了 呃 我胆子小 我会吓尿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please! Have mercy upon me! I'm a bed-wetter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.60,0:43:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不是吧 砍个头还要爬这么高吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. I mean, I have to walk upstairs as well for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.28,0:43:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把篮子拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.44,0:43:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要篮子干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basket? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.59,0:43:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.76,0:44:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不这样吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's an idea. Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.89,0:44:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我们用老办法 砸石头好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we try a good old-fashioned stoning, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.74,0:44:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就想被石头砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd kill to be stoned right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.46,0:44:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也能参与进来 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets the crowd involved, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.67,0:44:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见掏肠子的维克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to speak to Victor in Disembowelment.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.64,0:44:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见你们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to speak to…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.25,0:44:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不是个爱抱怨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not one to complain normally,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.77,0:44:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这个篮子都满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this basket's full of heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.93,0:44:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜·史密斯有遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final words of Carina Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.45,0:44:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.40,0:44:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜·史密斯有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final words of Carina Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.86,0:44:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good sirs, I'm not a witch…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.31,0:44:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我原谅你们的愚昧和无知\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I forgive your common dimwittedness and feeble brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.78,0:44:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 你们大多都是猪脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In short, most of you have the mind of a goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.93,0:44:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.09,0:44:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将被处决的人一般是没有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it not common practice for those about to be executed…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.65,0:44:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说遗言的吧？我也不是很清楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be granted a last, I don't know, something…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.14,0:44:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在发表一个重要的观点 请你耐心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I was making a point. If you could just be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.66,0:44:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.05,0:44:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑袋就要被砍下来了 情况紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head's about to be lopped off, hence the urgency.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.69,0:45:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脖子也快要断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my neck is to be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.16,0:45:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？某些情况下 脖子是不会断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that on occasion, the neck doesn't actually break?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.89,0:45:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 很疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.44,0:45:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.34,0:45:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吊了好几个小时 眼珠外凸舌头肿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen men swing for hours, eyes bulging, tongues swelling…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.64,0:45:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发出恶心的咯咯声 - 能让我先说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- revolting gurgling sound. - May I finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.61,0:45:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你太走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.48,0:45:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想被吊死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I was hung.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.69,0:45:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先把海盗杀了吧 我等着 - 女巫优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill the filthy pirate. I'll wait. - But witches first.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.14,0:45:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是女巫 你没听我说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a witch. Were you not listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是个猪脑子 听不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite hard to listen when you have the mind of a goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.58,0:45:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 都杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough! Kill them both!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.08,0:45:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拿个绳子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get another noose!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.45,0:45:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭你 想打败我们 小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think you could defeat us, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.99,0:45:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.02,0:45:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来转移视线的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just the diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.35,0:45:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.78,0:46:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧用石头砸我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still rather be stoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.69,0:46:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.03,0:46:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.05,0:46:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.30,0:46:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.93,0:47:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 该死的海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you pirate scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.83,0:47:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.14,0:47:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.58,0:47:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.96,0:47:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.00,0:47:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.43,0:47:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.78,0:47:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.58,0:47:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome, me lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.56,0:47:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道你们这帮叛徒会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew you'd come crawling back, traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.40,0:48:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是特纳家的小子 出了十个银币保你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Turner boy gave us 10 silver pieces to save your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始起我们就是盟友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this moment on, we are to be allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.23,0:48:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样不怀好意地抱着我 我们怎么当盟友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering where your left hand is, I'd say we're more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.60,0:48:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,能向我保证带我去找三叉戟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find the Trident together. Do I have your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.57,0:48:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证把你的手剁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're holding everything but my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.67,0:48:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就赐予你们救我的荣幸 但要给点儿钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I bestow upon you the honour of saving me for a small donation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.49,0:48:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望我们救你 还给你钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect us to pay you to save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.35,0:48:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.01,0:48:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要十个银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a mere 10 pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.92,0:48:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.45,0:48:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最多给你五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't pay more than five!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.08,0:48:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then… Eight it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.55,0:48:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没工夫跟你开玩笑 我现在快抱不住你的左舷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we could discuss this later as I'm having trouble hoisting your port!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.68,0:48:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是左舷 那是船尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are far from port. That is my stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.16,0:48:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.93,0:48:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.01,0:48:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.52,0:48:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要杀了逃兵 女巫就吊死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I kill the coward, the witch hangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.48,0:48:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是一举两得啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two for the price of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.05,0:48:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可千万别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.35,0:48:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀了我 我就得放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be difficult once he kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 这两个犯人能带我们找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, these two prisoners will lead us to the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.71,0:49:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.16,0:49:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得我们能找到三叉戟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think we can find the Trident?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.50,0:49:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉布斯总管 别瞎操心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Gibbs, you old worrywart,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.86,0:49:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没什么可担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing to be concerned about at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.40,0:49:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能出什么问题呢 你说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly go wrong, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.14,0:49:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？落到海盗手里被折磨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this was your plan? To be tortured and killed by pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.04,0:49:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让我找一艘船的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you needed a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.22,0:49:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也叫船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.45,0:49:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the shard!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.38,0:49:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好淹死的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:50:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲爱的船员们 今天终于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me dear beloved crew, finally, today is…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.11,0:50:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.82,0:50:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She floats!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.17,0:50:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,正前方有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.70,0:50:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.24,0:50:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不是要质疑您的决策和判断 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would never question your reason as a captain but…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.44,0:50:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 是什么原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is there a reason…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.47,0:51:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让船长您 往这个不太合适的方向前进？\N{\fnArial\fs30}as captain, you've chosen to sail in this unreasonable direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.57,0:51:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将有人登上我们的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the men to prepare to be boarded…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家各就各位 不许害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stand their ground and show no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.20,0:51:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 那艘船朝我们过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitán, a ship sails toward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.80,0:51:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉查船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitán Salazar…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.17,0:51:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你在找杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you be looking for Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.28,0:52:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold point!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.72,0:52:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And await orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.22,0:52:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是船长巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Captain Barbossa,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.28,0:52:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在您面前 怀着真心诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I stand before you with cordial intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.99,0:52:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀着真心诚意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cordial intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.64,0:52:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听到了吗？这个海盗跟我提诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that? This pirate wishes to be cordial.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.40,0:52:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也让你见识一下我的诚意 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me show you what my cordiality is, hombre.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.64,0:52:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的剑敲一下 你的人就会死一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I tap my sword, one of your men will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.52,0:52:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以有话快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I suggest that you speak quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.59,0:53:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么话还是赶紧说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might want to go a bit faster, Capitán.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jack Sparrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.31,0:53:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克去海里找三叉戟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack be sailing for the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.60,0:53:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是死人的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the sea belongs to the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.26,0:53:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟能掌控大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident controls the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.44,0:53:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.15,0:53:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.88,0:53:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论什么宝贝也救不了他 他死定了 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no treasure that can save him. He will die, as will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.12,0:53:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我才能带你找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I be the only one that can lead you to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.15,0:53:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你明天日出之前就能要了杰克的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I declare you shall have Jack's life by sunrise on the morrow…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.37,0:53:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 你就要我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can take me own then.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.32,0:53:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你同意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have an accord?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.88,0:53:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去找他 我就让你还能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to him, and you will live to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.67,0:53:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.80,0:53:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢您 不杀我的船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank ye on behalf of me crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.94,0:53:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你就带着剩下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, you can take what's left of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.03,0:54:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,活人跟我们结盟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The living come aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.43,0:54:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜 我们时间不多了 那些死人马上就追过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina, we haven't got much time. The dead are sailing straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.18,0:54:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.28,0:54:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 死人跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've spoken to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.36,0:54:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人跟你说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've spoken to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.67,0:54:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那海妖和人鱼也跟你说过话吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you spoken to krakens and mermaids as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.05,0:54:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都知道海妖不会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krakens don't speak. Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.44,0:54:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道 我就不该救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I never should have saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.67,0:54:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你说的一样 昨天晚上月亮变红了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, there was a blood moon, just as you described.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.60,0:54:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你发现了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what it revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.60,0:54:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我凭什么相信你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.46,0:54:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都让我抱你的左舷了 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trusted me to hold your port, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.33,0:54:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是船尾 你显然没有什么航海经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my stern. Clearly, you need to spend more time at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.24,0:54:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你发现什么了 我保证可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you found and I promise to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.32,0:54:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.40,0:54:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你当初找我干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you come to me, Carina?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.69,0:54:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们在这儿一起出海寻找同一件宝物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we tied together in the middle of the sea, chasing the same treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.70,0:54:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,血月显示一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moon revealed a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.83,0:54:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「要释放海之神力 则将一切分离」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To release the power of the sea, all must divide."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.61,0:54:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,分离？什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divide? What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.21,0:54:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.35,0:54:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会弄明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.64,0:55:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面根本没有海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no map in this map.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.46,0:55:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把日记还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.48,0:55:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把「无人能懂的海图」给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me The Map No Man Can Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.21,0:55:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你能看懂 就不叫「无人能懂的海图」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could read it, then it wouldn't be called "The Map No Man Can Read."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.66,0:55:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托别说了 你说不过她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you, please, don't argue with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.13,0:55:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这船上大多数人都不识字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the men on this ship can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.89,0:55:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以所有的海图都是… 无人能懂的海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes all maps The Maps That No Man Can Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.92,0:55:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你看不懂 那它就没用了 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you can't read it, then you have no use for it or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.82,0:55:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.71,0:55:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个海图给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.67,0:55:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给不了 它还没出现呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. It doesn't yet exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.52,0:55:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.96,0:55:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天文学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an astronomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.15,0:55:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 她是研究蚊子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Ah, she breeds donkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.41,0:55:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不是 天文学家是研究天空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. An astronomer contemplates the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.68,0:55:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对呀 蚊子就在天上飞 - 不是 跟蚊子没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, on a donkey? - No! There's no donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.85,0:55:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问一下 你怎么繁殖它们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how do you breed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.40,0:55:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把问题变简单一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to simplify this equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.01,0:55:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把海图给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the map…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.26,0:55:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will kill…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.71,0:55:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀他 我就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}him. I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.00,0:55:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.76,0:56:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吓唬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.21,0:56:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸红了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.42,0:56:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个小子扔下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.19,0:56:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.20,0:56:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 快点 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.24,0:56:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们管这叫「拖龙骨」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call this keelhauling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.21,0:56:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小亨利会被扔下船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Henry will be tossed over…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.08,0:56:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被拖到船的底部\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he will be dragged under the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.65,0:56:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 你们还等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What're you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.47,0:56:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 他不像是在吓唬…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he doesn't appear to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 闭嘴 - 不 我不是吓唬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zip, zip. - Nope, not bluffing, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.24,0:56:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.71,0:56:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 船上没吃的 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we don't have any food aboard. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.60,0:56:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是淹死了算运气好的 免得被藤壶活活刮死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's lucky, he'll drown before the barnacles shred him to ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.89,0:56:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,藤壶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barnacles?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.71,0:56:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一千把小刀在刮你的背\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a thousand knives across your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.57,0:56:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 血还会引来鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course the blood attracts sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.32,0:56:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.03,0:56:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,船头有鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shark off the bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.60,0:56:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 现在会游泳都救不了他的小命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say that swimming is no longer his primary concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.23,0:56:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,海图在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.12,0:56:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.04,0:56:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你手指尖儿上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the tip of your finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.12,0:56:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 在天上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. In the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.79,0:56:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,日记能帮我找到藏在星空里的海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}That diary will lead me to a map hidden in the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.69,0:57:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他上来 我今晚就能找到海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him up. I'll find it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.54,0:57:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚了 来不及了 你自己去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, can't bring him up. Look for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.76,0:57:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说嘛 脸红啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I said… blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.75,0:57:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.60,0:57:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海己被血染红\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea has turned to blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.77,0:57:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个水手被冲上岸说着什么三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sailor washed ashore talking about the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.82,0:57:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还要找杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was looking for Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.79,0:57:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那个海盗救走了纹刑架上的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same pirate who saved a witch from the gallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.90,0:57:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's no witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.03,0:57:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你一定会帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.21,0:57:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕了 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.01,0:57:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,船在夜色中燃烧 你想知道能否保护自 己\N{\fnArial\fs30}As ships burn in the night, you want to know if you can save your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.05,0:57:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道三叉戟是否真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Trident is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.39,0:57:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我解读那面墙上的信息 不然就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to read that wall for me or you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.16,0:57:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大英帝国要得到三叉戟 统治海洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British Empire will have the Trident and rule the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.86,0:58:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我那海盗要跟着女巫去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know where that pirate is going with that witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.25,0:58:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命运在这些星星之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your destiny is in these stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.90,0:58:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将为你指路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will set your course.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.38,0:58:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 面条吃人啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spaghetti wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.01,0:58:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道是这样我何必找你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did I bother coming to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.01,0:58:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人在追杀我们而你坐着等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead are hunting us down and you do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.59,0:58:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等死？我哪儿像等死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing! You call this nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.16,0:58:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道喝酒 还睡大觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're drunk! And you're sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.99,0:58:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得不错 小子 我一下儿就做了两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point exactly! I am doing two things at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.94,0:58:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人本来就没得救 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save the unsaveable, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.06,0:58:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 反正你一定要帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, Jack, you're going to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.93,0:58:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,破除我父亲身上的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will break my father's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.44,0:59:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你要举剑 小子 最好有胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you raise a sword, boy, be the last to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.04,0:59:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我教你一招 哄姑娘嘴巴要甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I suggest you entice her with a bit of flattery?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.05,0:59:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想救的我父亲 没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for my father, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.87,0:59:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 你肯定是爱上她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. Absolutely smitten with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.32,0:59:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定要小心 如果要追棕发女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, a bit of discretion when courting a brunette…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.70,0:59:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别追她的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}never pursue her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.73,0:59:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果你没法抗拒她姐姐的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you cannot avoid the charm of her sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.58,0:59:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就杀了她哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill the brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.84,0:59:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savvy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.63,0:59:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I do not savvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.20,0:59:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁伤过你的心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.99,0:59:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了 既然你听了我的忠告 你就要付我五个银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, that little sliver of knowledge will cost you five pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.83,0:59:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会付你钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not paying you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.45,0:59:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话跟女人可说不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never say that to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.25,1:00:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西你看不见 并不代表它不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you can't see something, doesn't mean it's not there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.76,1:00:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如海图？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the map?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.98,1:00:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.64,1:00:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我才能知道我是谁 我父亲是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only link to who I am. Who my father was.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.28,1:00:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们都是一心想要找回父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've both spent our lives searching for our fathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.52,1:00:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你和我就是同一类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you and I are closer than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.48,1:00:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出太阳了 你的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun is up, and so is your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.55,1:01:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要否认 但太阳完全升起 协议才算到期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to disagree, but the precision of our accord ends at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.55,1:01:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是一束光 离太阳完全升起还早着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This be but first light, far from a fully risin' sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.68,1:01:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道您是个讲信用的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you to be a man of honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.26,1:01:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,信用？你还不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honour? You know nothing of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.32,1:01:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道被杰克打败的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like to be bested by Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.09,1:01:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an enemy to us…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.89,1:01:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.89,1:01:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我听说过一个强大的西班牙船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard stories of a mighty Spanish captain,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.74,1:01:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是海上屠夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Matador Del Mar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.72,1:01:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他令人闻风丧胆 因为他追杀了上千人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who scourged the sea, hunted and killed thousands of men.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.64,1:01:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不是普通人 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Men, no. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.80,1:01:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海盗 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.85,1:01:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.74,1:01:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗像病菌一样在海上世代繁衍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates had infected the seas for generations.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.00,1:01:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得我父亲和我祖父丢了性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking the life of my father and his father before.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.48,1:01:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我发誓要彻底结束这场瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I vowed to end this plague once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.87,1:01:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到做到 摧毁了数十艘海盗船\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is what I did. I destroyed dozens of ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.33,1:02:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后几艘船联起手来 妄图要打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last ones joined together to try and defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.86,1:02:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就明白 一切都是徒劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they soon realised it was hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.23,1:02:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也抵挡不住沉默玛丽号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing could stop the Silent Mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.07,1:02:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们都给我击沉 快点儿 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit them below the water line. Vamos! Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.99,1:02:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, boys!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.18,1:02:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海终于恢复了… 平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea was finally pure.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.50,1:02:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,海面上再也没有碍眼的骷髅旗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their wretched flags would no longer stain the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.57,1:02:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们求您宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are begging for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.43,1:02:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宽恕？宽恕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy? Mercy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.62,1:03:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.05,1:03:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.88,1:03:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help us!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.60,1:03:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adiós!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.20,1:03:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.25,1:03:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要靠你了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you now, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.56,1:03:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个罗盘 能指出你心中的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}This compass points towards what you want most.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.96,1:03:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远 别背叛它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never betray it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.74,1:04:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是魔鬼三角区\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil's Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.65,1:04:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么看着几艘海盗船滚滚的浓烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of their ships were burning before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.73,1:04:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我享受着… 胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that moment of victory…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.43,1:04:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了他的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's when I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.52,1:04:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hold on, Capitán.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.42,1:04:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘船冲出了浓烟想要逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ship was trying to escape through the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.55,1:04:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多好的天气 出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lovely day for a sail, innit?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.30,1:04:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿 在瞭望台上有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there, in the crow's nest…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.96,1:04:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,年纪很小的海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was this young pirate boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.88,1:04:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来就剩下你和我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, there's just the two of us left.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.01,1:04:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在投降我就饶你一命 很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You surrender to me now and I'll let you live. Simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.36,1:04:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他站在那儿 就像一只小麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stood there looking like a little bird, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.50,1:04:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from that day…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.34,1:05:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字让我恨到了骨子里 一辈子都忘不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he earned himself a name that would haunt me for the rest of my days…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.94,1:05:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack the Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.67,1:05:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？你现在向我投降 我就放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then. You surrender to me now and I let you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.75,1:05:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证饶你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall let you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.34,1:05:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子 这小子竟敢如此藐视我的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This boy… This boy was mocking my power,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我追了上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I chased him…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.89,1:05:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要亲手割开他的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that I would run my knife along his neck…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.87,1:05:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 我就杀尽了所有海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when he was dead, I would finish finally with the pirate's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.52,1:05:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.90,1:05:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去纹架那边 拿些绳子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the gallows. Grab some lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.14,1:05:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备急转 向左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the bootleg. Portside.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.02,1:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,急转掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bootleg turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.34,1:07:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.00,1:07:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,向您上贡 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tribute, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.48,1:07:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.19,1:08:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took everything from me…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.81,1:08:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我充满了愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and filled me with rage.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.64,1:08:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.92,1:08:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事到这里就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here is where the tale ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.04,1:08:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 船长 看那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, Capitán. There!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.80,1:08:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found as promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.99,1:08:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说她有海图\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's saying she's got the map,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.67,1:08:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只有她能看得懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's the only one who can follow it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.37,1:08:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 宰了她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we should shoot her?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.87,1:08:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别动她 她能带我们找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her be. She will take us to the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.92,1:08:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个钟头前就这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been saying that for hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.44,1:08:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两件事她在蒙我们 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two things we know are true, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.20,1:08:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 大白天根本看不到星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Stars don't shine by day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.12,1:09:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢 她根本不懂蚊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she forgot the donkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.57,1:09:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么去找一片任何地图都没有标记出的陆地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we go to a spot where no land exists on any map?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.97,1:09:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这块航海钟和伦敦时间完全一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}This chronometer keeps the exact time in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.99,1:09:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用它测算地平纬度进而确定经度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm using it to make an altitude measurement to determine longitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.76,1:09:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能知道 我们在海上的精确位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only then will we find our exact spot at sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.33,1:09:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭一块表就能找到三叉戟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you expect to find the Trident with a timepiece?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.06,1:09:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.80,1:09:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计算方法非常地精准\N{\fnArial\fs30}My calculations are precise and true.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.08,1:09:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅研究天文 我还懂计时学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not only an astronomer, I'm also a horologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.20,1:09:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.76,1:09:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好丢人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shame in that, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.10,1:09:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得赚点钱 养活自己 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we all have to earn a living, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.92,1:09:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.10,1:09:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说的不是妓女的「妓」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm a horologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.69,1:09:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈跟你同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was my mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.88,1:09:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她不会像你一样当众说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she didn't crow about it as loud as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 你妈妈也喜欢研究这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying your mother was academically inclined?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.80,1:09:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数时候呢 只能是躺着… 研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like, horizontally reclined.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.88,1:09:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,计时学 关注的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horology is the study of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.29,1:09:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对了 我妈总是要看表\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was always looking at her watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.78,1:09:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我能作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can vouch for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.88,1:10:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以只有你能找到那个地方 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no one can find the "X" but you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.65,1:10:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 那蚊子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - And the donkey?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.34,1:10:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,后边有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship to the aft!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.10,1:10:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.55,1:10:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 死人不报仇的话 是不会安息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, the dead will not rest until they get their revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.91,1:10:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.00,1:10:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不不不 你可没说有死人的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. The dead were never part of this deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.32,1:10:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不应该跟着倒霉船长还有女巫出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have never followed a luckless pirate and a witch to sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.00,1:10:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这样 杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, that's it. Kill 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.74,1:10:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我？那 那 那我就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me and I'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.19,1:10:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那那些死人就… 就没办法找我报仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the other dead won't be able to have their revenge…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.89,1:10:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.64,1:10:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.20,1:10:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 那样只会激怒他们 他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Which will anger them even more. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.40,1:10:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.38,1:10:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们海盗都这么蠢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are all pirates this stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.28,1:10:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.24,1:10:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.56,1:10:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为船长 我倒是有一个提议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Captain, might I suggest…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.31,1:10:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛变？你就只能想到这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mutiny? You had to suggest a mutiny?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.46,1:10:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜 死人追上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina, the dead are coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.88,1:11:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我是不会相信的 都是超自然的胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I choose not to believe in supernatural nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.29,1:11:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到后面的船吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not see what's behind us?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.00,1:11:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放出去 把它们放出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop them. Drop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.48,1:11:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.25,1:11:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的死人要找杰克 而杰克在这条船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men on that ship are looking for Jack and Jack is on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.11,1:11:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要弃船逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm going to swim for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.46,1:11:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然这样？我要是你的话我也会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you do exactly what I would do if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.40,1:11:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡琳娜 快停下 - 不不不… 千万不要停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carina, stop that. - No, no, no. Don't stop that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.26,1:11:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做太过份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gone far enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.56,1:11:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿过份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it has not.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他的 继续 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen not to him. Carry on. Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.24,1:11:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧你？就剩最后一件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? She was almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.46,1:11:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她的腿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw her ankles.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.54,1:11:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小子要是闭嘴还能看到更多的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have seen a lot more if you'd have kept your cake hole shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.40,1:12:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吃了小麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.91,1:12:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不太妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's not good, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.55,1:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧划小子 快点 再快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep rowing, man. Faster. Faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.50,1:12:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.57,1:12:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.45,1:12:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要抛弃我 去找那个穿短衬裤的计时女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would leave me for some horologist in her knickers?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.73,1:12:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.29,1:12:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们男人都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You men are all alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.25,1:13:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.28,1:13:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.69,1:13:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样没什么用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't seem to be working!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.18,1:13:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说没用 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we'll be fine. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.52,1:14:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.94,1:14:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do they do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.04,1:14:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得游到岸上 我把鲨鱼引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to swim for it. I'll distract them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.88,1:14:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.98,1:14:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.26,1:14:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.68,1:15:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.96,1:15:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.13,1:16:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.78,1:16:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克小麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack the Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.44,1:16:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Spanish?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.97,1:16:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼 鬼 有鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.75,1:16:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 原来他们不能上岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. They're unable to step on land.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.40,1:16:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.49,1:16:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.24,1:16:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.09,1:16:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我的马上就该还了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will soon pay for what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.16,1:16:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不… 不 不必算那么清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. There's no need to bother, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.84,1:16:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡琳娜 - 我这会儿没空闲聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carina! - I have no time to chat…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.67,1:16:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的海图刚刚跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because me map's just run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.22,1:16:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就在这儿 等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.03,1:16:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等我干什么？哪个孙子要你等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you be waiting for me? Why would he be waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.76,1:16:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.02,1:17:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrum.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.26,1:17:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.22,1:17:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克总跟我说 要是他出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack always told me that if anything should ever happen to him…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.70,1:17:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望你来当船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wanted you to be captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.04,1:17:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们都支持您 而且您还戴着船长帽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but the men voted for you. That's why you got a captain's hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.25,1:17:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be that as it may…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.52,1:17:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是杰克的遗愿 所以要好好干 接他的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}them were his wishes, so be a good lad and take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.68,1:17:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, you…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.32,1:17:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴好船长帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}take the captain's hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.00,1:17:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.47,1:17:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道怎么感谢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the proudest moment of my…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.52,1:17:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不说出杰克的去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will beat your captain to death…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.23,1:17:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的船长就要被打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he reveals where they're heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.80,1:17:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.84,1:17:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊小伙子 我知道你在苦恼什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's ailing you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.18,1:17:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的内心正受着煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the unscratchable itch.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.60,1:17:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 只有跟着卡琳娜 才能找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina is the only one who can help us find the Trident…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.44,1:17:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有爱上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.95,1:17:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱？谁说你爱上她了？你自己说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love? Who said anything about love? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.74,1:17:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你说我内心煎熬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unscratchable itch?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.31,1:18:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,疥疮 我说的是疥疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scabies. I'm talking about scabies.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.46,1:18:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小虫子在皮肤底下钻来钻去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small mites that burrow under the skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.64,1:18:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多年了 真是太难熬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's certainly ailing me, has been for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.89,1:18:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.95,1:18:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.19,1:18:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊 - 卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carina! - Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.50,1:18:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亨利 快救我 - 快救啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry, help me! - Help her!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.48,1:18:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在下令 你们全都给我去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}By rule of the King, I sentence you all to death!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.92,1:18:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得呀 咱俩该互相坦白一下藏宝贝的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should tell each other where our treasures are buried…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.24,1:18:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定咱俩谁能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case one of us survives.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.36,1:18:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.36,1:18:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.01,1:18:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝埋在阿鲁巴岛两裸棕榈树之间的野坟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My treasure is buried between two crossed palm trees in an unmarked grave in Aruba.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.27,1:18:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.32,1:18:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't got any.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.75,1:18:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过能让我杀了杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised me Jack's blood!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.43,1:18:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jack be trapped!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.32,1:18:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他休想离开那座岛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can never escape that island.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.17,1:18:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他上了岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on land!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.92,1:18:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.36,1:19:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遵守了协定 我可以带我的人上岸去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I upheld our deal. Me men and meself will go ashore.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.11,1:19:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把杰克给你抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scurvy traitor will be yours…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.35,1:19:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的荣誉担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}on me honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.69,1:19:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣誉？什么荣誉 伙计？什么荣誉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honour? What honour, hombre? What honour?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.18,1:19:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不懂得荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what honour is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.57,1:19:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先饶了我一命 我去把杰克给你抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me my life, and I'll fetch you the Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.99,1:19:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An accord?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.64,1:19:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.42,1:19:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.96,1:19:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 斯派罗 你欠的债该还了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Sparrow. It's time to pay your debt.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.98,1:19:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪头… 猪头凯利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pig… Pig Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.12,1:19:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me old mates.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.91,1:20:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友？你们听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mates? You hear that, boys?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.49,1:20:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个满嘴瞎话的家伙欠了我一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This lyin' pirate owes me a plunder of silver…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.89,1:20:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天居然跑到刽子手湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and luck has brought him to Hangman's Bay…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.92,1:20:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己送上门来了 那好 还钱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he can settle his debt here and now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.99,1:20:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 呃 这个 那什么我会 我会还的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I will. I will, Pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.88,1:20:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么还你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name your price.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.96,1:20:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个老婆 比阿特丽斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Beatrice…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.56,1:20:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可怜的妹妹 守寡多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's my poor, widowed sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.40,1:20:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.64,1:20:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来想找个体面的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been looking for a respectable man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.42,1:20:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你也凑合\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.63,1:20:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧开始吧 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis, let's get on with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.03,1:20:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 为什么我要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Why? Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.92,1:20:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让她活得体面些\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make an honest woman of her, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.27,1:20:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 杰克 今天结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. It's your wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.35,1:20:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.77,1:20:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去谷仓里度蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll honeymoon in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.72,1:20:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.24,1:20:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说猪头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Pig, how could I…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.04,1:20:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能昧着良心娶她\N{\fnArial\fs30}honestly make an honest woman out of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.39,1:20:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没办法让她这样的女人活得体面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… Her. I mean, her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.02,1:21:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一群又是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.57,1:21:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our children.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.24,1:21:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别看他们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best not look them in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.52,1:21:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有请伴郎和伴娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the best man and the bridesmaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.27,1:21:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他的眼睛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked it in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.51,1:21:13.77,Title,0,0,0,0,,请把你的手放到《圣经》上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your hand on the Bible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.77,1:21:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 那个 那个 我有疥疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got scabies.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.62,1:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也有 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So do I. - Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.72,1:21:19.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,把你的手放到《圣经》上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your hand on the Bible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.48,1:21:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在还尿床呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bed-wetter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.14,1:21:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「你愿意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "I do".
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.66,1:21:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我一枪打爆你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll put a bullet in your skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.51,1:21:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你不说我们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, they're going to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.82,1:21:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁管你啊 - 赶紧说你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care! - Just say "I do."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.58,1:21:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最后一次机会 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last chance, Jack. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.36,1:21:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样肯定 呃 肯定不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely, this is not legal.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.16,1:21:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not legal.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.60,1:21:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.84,1:21:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人愿意站出来 反对这桩婚姻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does any man here object to these nuptials?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.93,1:21:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我愿意 - 祝贺你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do. - Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.47,1:21:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以亲吻新娘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may kiss the bride!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.08,1:21:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.46,1:21:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你 你… 你爱吃海鲜 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… You like seafood, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.51,1:21:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.04,1:22:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我们又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.40,1:22:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.76,1:22:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是我全世界最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me bestest mate in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.32,1:22:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你迟早要安定下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew you'd settle down eventually.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.11,1:22:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带礼物来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring me a gift?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.84,1:22:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个算吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.66,1:22:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色不错 走路可真有劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look marvellous. Got quite the spring in your step.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.18,1:22:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,断腿长出来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has your leg grown back?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.36,1:22:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 船长 我们该回去找萨拉查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Captain, shouldn't we be getting back to Salazar…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.19,1:22:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用斯派罗的命换我们自己的啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}trade Mr Sparrow's life in for our own?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.98,1:22:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, that we could…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.57,1:22:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我是来找三叉戟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've come for the Trident of Poseidon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.84,1:22:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要骗那个死人船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna double-cross the dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.52,1:22:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向他保证了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.92,1:22:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了三叉戟 我就能重新掌控大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with it, I'll gut the dead that stole my command of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.90,1:22:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来是个不错的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I love this plan…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.24,1:22:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有船快得过那艘破烂的鬼船\N{\fnArial\fs30}no vessel can outrun that wretched hull of a ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.77,1:22:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真有 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there be one, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.47,1:22:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道最快的船 黑珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fastest ship I know, the Pearl…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.60,1:22:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前被黑胡子封印在了一个玻璃瓶子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}trapped in that bottle by Blackbeard five winters ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.52,1:23:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭借黑胡子那老东西的宝剑之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the power of that blackguard's sovereign blade…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.43,1:23:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要释放黑珍珠号 让它重现昔日的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby release the Black Pearl to her former and rightful glory.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.09,1:23:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.24,1:23:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家做好准备啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.22,1:23:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.93,1:23:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来了 要来了 要来了 来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming! It's coming, it's coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.96,1:23:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家退后 都退后 它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand aside! Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.98,1:23:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它缩小了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's shrunken.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.16,1:23:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么会变这么小？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't it unshrink?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.76,1:23:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计是太冷了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's cold, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.38,1:24:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,船应该在海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.36,1:24:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,多好的一艘船呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a fine ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.58,1:24:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘船只能有一个船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}There be room for only one captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.80,1:25:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嗯 讨厌的小畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Filthy beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.29,1:25:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该和死人赛一场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to race the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.14,1:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在岸上才安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only safe place is the land.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.40,1:25:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛要离开陆地呢？你说是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we going away from the land? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.25,1:25:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 你的海图不够完善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, your map is incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.05,1:25:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你们去找三叉戟 只要你信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take us to the Trident if you'd only trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.91,1:25:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.74,1:25:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有没有在听我说话呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not hear anything I just said?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.20,1:25:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭几颗星星 你说就能看出一幅海图来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you be saying that that star is pretendin' to be a map?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.00,1:25:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 所有的地图上都没有标出这个女人所说的岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there is no island on any map to support what the woman says.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.32,1:25:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 你明白不了她说的含义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, you don't have to understand her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.73,1:25:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信她就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just believe her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.12,1:25:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.82,1:25:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有个什么尖东西 我能把锁撬开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had something sharp, I could pick that lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.33,1:25:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这鬼地方哪有什么尖东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna find anything sharp in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.52,1:26:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再乱动了 烦死个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep still, you bilge rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.13,1:26:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.01,1:26:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想当船长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please! I don't wanna be captain any more!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.88,1:26:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.12,1:26:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 你不会是要让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you wouldn't allow…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.28,1:26:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人来掌舵吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a woman to steer your ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.49,1:26:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她看着星星导航 不然我们就都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will follow her star, or we'll all die together.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.37,1:26:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠号 它又起航了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Pearl! She sails again!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.12,1:26:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lads!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.46,1:27:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船 那些鬼魂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ship, those ghosts…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.08,1:27:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,逻辑上有点儿说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no logical explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.88,1:27:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些海上的传说是真的 卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The myths of the sea are real, Carina.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.42,1:27:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总算知道自己是错的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you can finally see you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.56,1:27:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,错的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.68,1:27:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有点疑惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I had some doubts.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.16,1:27:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样跟别人道歉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the worst apology I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.14,1:27:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,道歉？我 我为什么要道歉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apology? Why would I apologise?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.77,1:27:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们被死人追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we've been chased by the dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.20,1:27:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后开着从瓶子里拿出来的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}sailing on a ship raised from a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.95,1:27:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是解释一下啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your science in that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.27,1:27:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, then I will apologise.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.42,1:27:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.28,1:27:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你也应该向我道歉才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although one could argue that you owe me an apology…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.33,1:27:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你害得我差点被那些坏蛋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as my life has been threatened by pirates and dead men.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.02,1:27:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你现在相信了 真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you now believe in, sorry to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.91,1:27:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就原谅你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.05,1:27:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去瞭望台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.30,1:27:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你理解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you see it my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.09,1:27:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左十二度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve degrees to port!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.38,1:27:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪炮准备 - 遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready the guns. - Aye!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.22,1:27:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪炮准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready the guns!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.06,1:27:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些海盗要去找三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those pirates are going for the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你从哪儿得来的 小姑娘？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that from, missy?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.61,1:28:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this book.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.73,1:28:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年前 它被人从一艘意大利船上偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen from an Italian ship many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.94,1:28:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,被偷走？不 你搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen? No, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.71,1:28:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我印象很深刻 封皮上应该有一颗红宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a ruby on the cover I would not soon forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.88,1:28:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我父亲留给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was given to me by my father…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.99,1:28:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他是个科学家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was clearly a man of science.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.98,1:28:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他是个偷东西的贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was clearly a common thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.48,1:28:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会允许一个海盗 玷污我父亲的名誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The memory of my father will not be defiled by the tongue of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.78,1:28:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这日记我生来就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This diary is my birthright.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.94,1:28:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲把它和我一起留在孤儿院门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left to me on the steps of a children's home.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.64,1:28:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写着我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with a name and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.65,1:28:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这么说你是孤儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you're an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.51,1:28:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What be you called?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.25,1:28:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和北方最亮的星座同一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brightest star in the North gave me my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.28,1:29:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该就是卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be Carina.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.64,1:29:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜·史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.35,1:29:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还懂点天文\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you do know your stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.36,1:29:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.02,1:29:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道哪颗星星能带我返航\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know which stars to follow home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.06,1:30:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.35,1:30:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密斯是个多么特别的姓氏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smyth is quite an unusual name.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.84,1:30:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前是不是认识那谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we not once…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.16,1:30:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也姓史密斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}know someone called Smyth?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.43,1:30:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.90,1:30:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过名字呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.96,1:30:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了舌尖上说不出来了 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right on the tip of me tongue. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.44,1:30:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想不想要舌头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna lose that tongue?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.92,1:30:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特·史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.69,1:30:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.27,1:30:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我们做笔交易？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we make an accord then?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.21,1:30:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我也可以去告诉某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or shall I tell you-know-who.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.12,1:30:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都心知肚明的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we both know to be true?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.08,1:30:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事你我到死都不能说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both take this secret to our graves.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.78,1:30:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说是真的？我只是试探一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, it is true? I was bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.64,1:30:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.64,1:30:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是死了 你拿什么跟死人船长谈条件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill me, you got nothing to bargain the dead with.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.33,1:30:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你得让我活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.40,1:30:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不说 巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to be frank, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.61,1:30:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得可真不是一般的丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very, very ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.15,1:30:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就能生出这么个漂亮俊俏的女儿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how could you produce a fetching creature such as that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.78,1:30:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妈妈死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret died.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.62,1:30:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这当爸爸的虽然混蛋 可我也盼着女儿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I summoned as much honour as a worthless blaggard ever could.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.00,1:30:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她送到了孤儿院之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I placed the infant in an orphanage…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.21,1:30:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没有去看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}never to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.77,1:31:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下个红宝石 以为她能过得好一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the ruby might afford her some ease in life…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.61,1:31:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到她会去研究日记本里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I never imagined she'd take those scribblings…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.60,1:31:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还当成了人生志向\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make a life of her own.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.45,1:31:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果又找回到我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life that's led her back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.22,1:31:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来现在的情况 对我好像非常有利啊 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say this puts me in a rather favourable position, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.04,1:31:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要什么你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.59,1:31:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我的罗盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want me compass.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.71,1:31:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要216大桶上好的朗姆酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}216 barrels of rum.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.29,1:31:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.89,1:31:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想养它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.23,1:31:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃它 我要吃掉它 我要吃了这猴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner. I want to eat him, I want to eat that monkey…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.40,1:31:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No deal, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.70,1:31:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么聪明的一个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clever young woman such as that would never believe…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.40,1:31:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绝对不会相信 我这样的人会是她的老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a swine like me could ever be her blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.66,1:31:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟 我一定能得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Trident will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.95,1:31:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redcoats!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.37,1:31:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redcoats!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.68,1:32:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.64,1:32:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备开炮 - 准备开炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prepare to fire! - Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.92,1:32:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man that gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.55,1:32:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌军在右舷方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}She comes starboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.04,1:32:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要战斗到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall fight to the last.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.17,1:32:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠号绝不能再次被人夺走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pearl will not be taken from me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.28,1:32:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.49,1:32:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,海上的控制权只能属于大英帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the British Empire will hold to the power of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.30,1:33:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论发生什么 你只管开船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, stay your course.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.37,1:33:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.74,1:33:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗 我来找你讨债了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Sparrow. I've come with a butcher's bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.74,1:33:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波萨呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.95,1:33:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好自己 伙计们 跟他们拼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defend yourselves, men. To the death!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.66,1:34:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能快点儿 你是拿黄油磨的刀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, man. What did you sharpen it with? Butter?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.90,1:34:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你还往哪儿躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere to hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.15,1:34:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,壮起胆子 保卫黑珍珠 呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be brave. Save the Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.12,1:34:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.50,1:34:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就是这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.62,1:35:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找到那片陆地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find that land.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.33,1:35:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we'll all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.50,1:35:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're nearly there!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.32,1:35:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它 它就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.96,1:35:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.52,1:35:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.16,1:36:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.08,1:36:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.52,1:36:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你要找的地方没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you found what you're looking for yet, miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.62,1:36:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.25,1:36:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星就要看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars will soon be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.07,1:36:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.82,1:37:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.56,1:37:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.58,1:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The island is there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.46,1:37:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.32,1:37:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The island.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.22,1:37:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.67,1:37:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回玛丽号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the Mary!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.48,1:37:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.04,1:38:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carina!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.41,1:38:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.20,1:38:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利被抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.54,1:38:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有三叉戟能救他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident be all that can save him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.15,1:38:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要找到三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.72,1:38:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.44,1:39:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它肯定在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.08,1:39:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来看 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.24,1:39:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这么美丽的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the most beautiful thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.92,1:39:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我父亲希望我找到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what my father wanted me to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.19,1:39:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,礁石？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rocks?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.24,1:39:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是礁石\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.31,1:39:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.66,1:39:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是「无人能懂的海图」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is The Map No Man Can Read.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.44,1:39:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座海岛 完全就是星空的倒影\N{\fnArial\fs30}This island is a perfect reflection of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.76,1:40:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿缺了一颗星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}One star's missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.80,1:40:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.67,1:40:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到三叉戟 去救亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find the Trident to save Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.25,1:40:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波萨 有件事得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector, I think you should know,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.96,1:40:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个计时女\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's a horologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.36,1:40:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不亮了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't it glowing?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.54,1:40:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去吧 卡琳娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish it, Carina.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.57,1:40:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺失的星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missing star.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.61,1:40:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.47,1:40:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.80,1:40:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.28,1:42:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.12,1:42:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,海神波塞冬之墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poseidon's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.52,1:42:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.68,1:42:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 您知道这很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitán, you know the danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.61,1:42:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.59,1:42:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.61,1:42:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克在陆地就要得到三叉戟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack is on land going for the Trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.43,1:42:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitán, there must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.21,1:42:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦您附身活人就再也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you possess the living, there's no coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.77,1:42:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,您会困在他的身体里出不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be trapped in his body forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.19,1:42:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟能让我恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident will set me free.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.97,1:42:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只麻雀的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to kill a Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.31,1:42:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.77,1:43:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 杰克 它在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Jack. There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.74,1:43:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.40,1:43:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack! - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.69,1:43:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.26,1:44:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤我 就是伤那小子 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut me, you cut the boy, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.29,1:44:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.04,1:45:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hola, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.03,1:45:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.92,1:45:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你 斯派罗 去死吧 斯派罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the Sparrow. Die, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.00,1:45:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.24,1:45:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到陆地上来了 快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's walking on land. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.70,1:45:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.04,1:45:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 快滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, piss off!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.82,1:45:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.27,1:46:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利快醒醒 杰克要被他杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, wake up. He's killing Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.99,1:46:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.76,1:46:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,海之神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.73,1:46:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.13,1:46:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放海之神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.00,1:46:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要释放海之神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To release the power of the sea…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.84,1:46:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,则将一切分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}"all must divide."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.82,1:46:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然三叉戟蕴含一切力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Trident holds all the power, then…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.67,1:46:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也包括诅咒的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then every curse is held inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.55,1:46:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前就跟你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told you before…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.66,1:46:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在向我投降 我就饶你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrender to me now and I'll let you…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.72,1:46:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}live.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.72,1:46:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我投降吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.84,1:46:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.62,1:46:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的传说结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the tale ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.35,1:46:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.70,1:46:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.69,1:47:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divide.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.98,1:47:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.19,1:47:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.92,1:47:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,分离 断开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divide. Break.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.04,1:47:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,打断三叉戟就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break the Trident and you'll…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.08,1:47:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破所有的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break every curse at sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.88,1:48:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒全都解除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All curses are broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.12,1:48:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are flesh and blood!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.51,1:48:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.78,1:48:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.88,1:48:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.96,1:48:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.57,1:48:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万要稳住伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it steady, boys!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.18,1:48:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它滑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let her slip!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.63,1:49:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.95,1:49:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.21,1:49:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.21,1:49:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 起锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up! Anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.84,1:49:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把锚拉起来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the anchor up! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.92,1:49:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停 快拉起来 拉起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.32,1:49:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,反着推 快拉起来 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it up! Bring it up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.02,1:49:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.48,1:49:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitán! Capitán!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.66,1:50:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crumbs!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.41,1:50:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.76,1:50:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.86,1:50:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.16,1:50:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.16,1:50:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.56,1:51:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.85,1:51:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.53,1:51:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.19,1:52:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住右舷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her starboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.67,1:53:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗的命啊 巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirate's life, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.96,1:53:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.55,1:53:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.35,1:53:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一瞬间我感觉拥有了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a moment, I had everything, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.94,1:53:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又什么都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's all gone again.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.64,1:53:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是都没了 史密斯小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not all gone, Ms Smyth.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.76,1:54:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.49,1:54:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的姓是巴波萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.31,1:54:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许杰克说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Jack was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.29,1:54:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.07,1:54:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我内心深处的煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The unscratchable itch.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.50,1:55:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么打我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.73,1:55:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看是不是真的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking it's truly you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.70,1:55:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕你是鬼附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're not still a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.39,1:55:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.87,1:55:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 那就算我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I was…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.83,1:55:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.88,1:55:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小失误 虽然 这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slightly in error. Although…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.56,1:55:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在原谅你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.61,1:55:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷兰人号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.58,1:56:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.69,1:56:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.78,1:56:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look at you, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.99,1:56:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.24,1:56:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么打破诅咒的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you break the curse?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.73,1:56:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你讲一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you a tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.72,1:56:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于人世间最珍贵的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tale of the greatest treasure known to man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.18,1:56:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我一定要听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a tale I wanna hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.83,1:57:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心得叫人饭都吃不下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a truly revolting sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.87,1:57:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.37,1:57:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克船长过甲板了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Jack Sparrow on deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.86,1:57:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.20,1:57:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.28,1:57:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢你 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you very much. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.53,1:57:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.33,1:58:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.52,1:58:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.68,1:58:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你 船长 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sirs. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.23,1:58:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 吉布斯总管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. Master Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.18,1:58:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你来掌舵 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship is yours, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.80,1:58:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.13,1:58:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.55,1:58:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.58,1:58:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来去哪儿 船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What be our heading, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.78,1:58:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用星星导航 吉布斯总管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall follow the stars, Master Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.19,1:58:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, aye, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.15,1:58:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去最爱的天边 赴一个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a rendezvous beyond my beloved horizon.
